NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Caerphilly and across South Wales. From new businesses needing their first logo to established companies refreshing an outdated identity, we design logos built to work across every platform and every format.

## Why branding matters in Caerphilly

Local customers notice the details. A professional logo tells potential customers that you're established, credible, and serious about your business. Whether it appears on your website, your vehicle, your shopfront, or your social media, a strong identity is often what tips the decision in your favour.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts to choose from
- Revisions until you're completely happy
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG

See our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/) for full details.

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is created in Adobe Illustrator — no AI tools, no stock templates. Your logo is original and unique to your business.

